# Pairs with OriginAuthenticated. A control verb drops the authorized-peer
# check, so a cluster removed from the topology whose secret is still
# configured keeps driving saga state.
MODULE: ReceiverControlAdmitsFormerPeer
TARGET: OriginAuthenticated
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a control verb admits a credential-bound origin outside the topology

--- FIND
         ELSE IF hdr \notin Topology THEN <<"denied", NoHeader>>
--- REPLACE
         ELSE IF FALSE THEN <<"denied", NoHeader>>
--- END